					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Cards_List" title="Slay the Spire 2:Cards List">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="ambox" style="--ambox-color: var(--highlight-color-rare);"><div class="ambox-icon metadata"><img alt="" src="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></div><div class="ambox-content"><p class="ambox-text"><i>This is the list of every card in Slay the Spire 1. Information about <b>Cards</b> can be found at <a href="/wiki/Cards" title="Cards">Cards</a>.</i></p></div></div>
<div><div id="card-filters"></div><div id="results"><div id="sortingResults">Default sorting</div><div id="numResults">Showing 370 results</div></div><div id="cardsContainer" class="list-container" data-sequel="1"><div class="card-box" data-name="Bash" data-rarity="Basic" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Vulnerable"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash"><img alt="Red-Bash.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Bash.png/150px-Red-Bash.png?57867c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Bash.png/225px-Red-Bash.png?57867c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Bash.png/300px-Red-Bash.png?57867c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash"><img alt="Red-BashPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-BashPlus.png/150px-Red-BashPlus.png?3df4ff" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-BashPlus.png/225px-Red-BashPlus.png?3df4ff 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-BashPlus.png/300px-Red-BashPlus.png?3df4ff 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash"><img alt="Beta-Red-BashPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BashPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-BashPlus.png?ab39a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BashPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-BashPlus.png?ab39a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-BashPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-BashPlus.png?ab39a5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash"><img alt="Beta-Red-Bash.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Bash.png/150px-Beta-Red-Bash.png?db1fba" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Bash.png/225px-Beta-Red-Bash.png?db1fba 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Bash.png/300px-Beta-Red-Bash.png?db1fba 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bash" title="Bash">Bash</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Basic" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Basic - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 8 damage.<br />Apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 10 damage.<br />Apply 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Defend (Ironclad)" data-rarity="Basic" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)"><img alt="Red-Defend.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Defend.png/150px-Red-Defend.png?c0245b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Defend.png/225px-Red-Defend.png?c0245b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Defend.png/300px-Red-Defend.png?c0245b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)"><img alt="Red-DefendPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DefendPlus.png/150px-Red-DefendPlus.png?7a7e56" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DefendPlus.png/225px-Red-DefendPlus.png?7a7e56 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DefendPlus.png/300px-Red-DefendPlus.png?7a7e56 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)"><img alt="Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png?b583ee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png?b583ee 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-DefendPlus.png?b583ee 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)"><img alt="Beta-Red-Defend.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Defend.png/150px-Beta-Red-Defend.png?962306" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Defend.png/225px-Beta-Red-Defend.png?962306 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Defend.png/300px-Beta-Red-Defend.png?962306 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Ironclad)" title="Defend (Ironclad)">Defend (Ironclad)</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Basic" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Basic - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 8 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Strike (Ironclad)" data-rarity="Basic" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="Red-Strike.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Strike.png/150px-Red-Strike.png?e35894" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Strike.png/225px-Red-Strike.png?e35894 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Strike.png/300px-Red-Strike.png?e35894 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="Red-StrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-StrikePlus.png/150px-Red-StrikePlus.png?e9819c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-StrikePlus.png/225px-Red-StrikePlus.png?e9819c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-StrikePlus.png/300px-Red-StrikePlus.png?e9819c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png?85bd5a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png?85bd5a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-StrikePlus.png?85bd5a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)"><img alt="Beta-Red-Strike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Strike.png/150px-Beta-Red-Strike.png?524828" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Strike.png/225px-Beta-Red-Strike.png?524828 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Strike.png/300px-Beta-Red-Strike.png?524828 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Ironclad)" title="Strike (Ironclad)">Strike (Ironclad)</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Basic" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Basic - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 6 damage.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 9 damage.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Anger" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger"><img alt="Red-Anger.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Anger.png/150px-Red-Anger.png?6ec1f5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Anger.png/225px-Red-Anger.png?6ec1f5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Anger.png/300px-Red-Anger.png?6ec1f5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger"><img alt="Red-AngerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-AngerPlus.png/150px-Red-AngerPlus.png?243bb2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-AngerPlus.png/225px-Red-AngerPlus.png?243bb2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-AngerPlus.png/300px-Red-AngerPlus.png?243bb2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger"><img alt="Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png?97fd93" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png?97fd93 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-AngerPlus.png?97fd93 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Anger" title="Anger"><img alt="Bet