k" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Deal 7 damage.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Perfected Strike" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Perfected_Strike" title="Perfected Strike"><img alt="Red-PerfectedStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrike.png/150px-Red-PerfectedStrike.png?ef94d5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrike.png/225px-Red-PerfectedStrike.png?ef94d5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrike.png/300px-Red-PerfectedStrike.png?ef94d5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Perfected_Strike" title="Perfected Strike"><img alt="Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/150px-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png?97ebb7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/225px-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png?97ebb7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/300px-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png?97ebb7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Perfected_Strike" title="Perfected Strike"><img alt="Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png?641e47" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png?641e47 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-PerfectedStrikePlus.png/300