" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 7 damage and apply 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="True Grit" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/True_Grit" title="True Grit"><img alt="Red-TrueGrit.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-TrueGrit.png/150px-Red-TrueGrit.png?b3dd6d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-TrueGrit.png/225px-Red-TrueGrit.png?b3dd6d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-TrueGrit.png/300px-Red-TrueGrit.png?b3dd6d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/True_Grit" title="True Grit"><img alt="Red-TrueGritPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-TrueGritPlus.png/150px-Red-TrueGritPlus.png?920827