="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span> 1 card at random.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 9 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span> 1 card.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Twin Strike" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike"><img alt="Red-TwinStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-TwinStrike.png/150px-Red-TwinStrike.png?61b2d6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-TwinStrike.png/225px-Red-TwinStrike.png?61b2d6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-TwinStrike.png/300px-Red-TwinStrike.png?61b2d6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike"><img alt="Red-TwinStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/150px-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?2513f0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/225px-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?2513f0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/300px-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?2513f0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike"><img alt="Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?95d34c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?95d34c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-TwinStrikePlus.png?95d34c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike"><img alt="Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png/150px-Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png?495b4d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png/225px-Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png?495b4d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png/300px-Beta-Red-TwinStrike.png?495b4d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Twin_Strike" title="Twin Strike">Twin Strike</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Common" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Common - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 5 damage twice.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 7 damage twice.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Warcry" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Warcry" title="Warcry"><img alt="Red-Warcry.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Warcry.png/150px-Red-Warcry.png?33ce58" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Warcry.png/225px-Red-Warcry.png?33ce58 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Warcry.png/300px-Red-Warcry.png?33ce58 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Warcry" title="Warcry"><img alt="Red-WarcryPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-WarcryPlus.png/150px-Red-WarcryPlus.png?61666c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-WarcryPlus.png/225px-Red-WarcryPlus.png?61666c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-WarcryPlus.png/300px-Red-WarcryPlus.png?61666c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Warcry" title="Warcry"><img alt="Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png?f4bf06" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png?f4bf06 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-WarcryPlus.png?f4bf06 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Warcry" title="Warcry"><img alt="Beta-Red-Warcry.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Warcry.png/150px-Beta-Red-Warcry.png?7249b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Warcry.png/225px-Beta-Red-Warcry.png?7249b4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Warcry.png/300px-Beta-Red-Warcry.png?7249b4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Warcry" title="Warcry">Warcry</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Common" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Common - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Draw 1 card.<br />Put a card from your hand onto the top of your draw pile.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Draw 2 cards.<br />Put a card from your hand onto the top of your draw pile.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Wild Strike" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Wild_Strike" title="Wild Strike"><img alt="Red-WildStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-WildStrike.png/150px-Red-WildStrike.png?393e66" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-WildStrike.png/225px-Red-WildStrike.png?393e66 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-WildStrike.png/300px-Red-WildStrike.png?393e66 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wild_Strike" title="Wild Strike"><img alt="Red-WildStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-WildStrikePlus.png/150px-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?df45ee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-WildStrikePlus.png/225px-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?df45ee 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-WildStrikePlus.png/300px-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?df45ee 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wild_Strike" title="Wild Strike"><img alt="Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?45b9c8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?45b9c8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-WildStrikePlus.png?45b9c8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wild_Strike" title="Wild Strike"><img alt="Beta-Red-WildStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrike.png/150px-Beta-Red-WildStrike.png?62b666" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrike.png/225px-Beta-Red-WildStrike.png?62b666 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-WildStrike.png/300px-Beta-Red-WildStrike.png?62b666 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Wild_Strike" title="Wild Strike">Wild Strike</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Common" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Common - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 12 damage.<br />Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wound" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound">Wound</a></span> into your draw pile.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 17 damage.<br />Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wound" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wound" title="Wound">Wound</a></span> into your draw pile.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Battle Trance" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw No Draw"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Trance" title="Battle Trance"><img alt="Red-BattleTrance.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-BattleTrance.png/150px-Red-BattleTrance.png?7f412b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-BattleTrance.png/225px-Red-BattleTrance.png?7f412b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-BattleTrance.png/300px-Red-BattleTrance.png?7f412b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Trance" title="Battle Trance"><img alt="Red-BattleTrancePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/150px-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?32f67d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/225px-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?32f67d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/300px-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?32f67d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Trance" title="Battle Trance"><img alt="Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?cc978a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?cc978a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-BattleTrancePlus.png?cc978a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Trance" title="Battle Trance"><img alt="Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png/150px-Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png?560f71" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png/225px-Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png?560f71 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png/300px-Beta-Red-BattleTrance.png?560f71 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Trance" title="Battle Trance">Battle Trance</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Draw 3 cards.<br />You cannot draw additional cards this turn.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Draw 4 cards.<br />You cannot draw additional cards this turn.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Blood for Blood" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-