-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Ironclad - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>,<br />draw 1 card.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>,<br />draw 1 card.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Disarm" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Strength (Negative)"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm"><img alt="Red-Disarm.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Disarm.png/150px-Red-Disarm.png?31ee8a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Disarm.png/225px-Red-Disarm.png?31ee8a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Disarm.png/300px-Red-Disarm.png?31ee8a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm"><img alt="Red-DisarmPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DisarmPlus.png/150px-Red-DisarmPlus.png?8c8a18" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DisarmPlus.png/225px-Red-DisarmPlus.png?8c8a18 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DisarmPlus.png/300px-Red-DisarmPlus.png?8c8a18 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm"><img alt="Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png?d807e0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png?d807e0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-DisarmPlus.png?d807e0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm"><img alt="Beta-Red-Disarm.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Disarm.png/150px-Beta-Red-Disarm.png?c3515a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Disarm.png/225px-Beta-Red-Disarm.png?c3515a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Disarm.png/300px-Beta-Red-Disarm.png?c3515a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm">Disarm</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Enemy loses 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Enemy loses 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Dropkick" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Energy Vulnerable"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dropkick" title="Dropkick"><img alt="Red-Dropkick.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Dropkick.png/150px-Red-Dropkick.png?89d632" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Dropkick.png/225px-Red-Dropkick.png?89d632 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Dropkick.png/300px-Red-Dropkick.png?89d632 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dropkick" title="Dropkick"><img alt="Red-DropkickPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DropkickPlus.png/150px-Red-DropkickPlus.png?232931" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DropkickPlus.png/225px-Red-DropkickPlus.png?232931 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DropkickPlus.png/300px-Red-DropkickPlus.png?232931 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dropkick" title="Dropkick"><img alt="Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png?6e5f03" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png?6e5f03 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-DropkickPlus.png?6e5f03 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dropkick" title="Dropkick"><img alt="Beta-Red-Dropkick.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Dropkick.png/150px-Beta-Red-Dropkick.png?fd27f7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Dropkick.png/225px-Beta-Red-Dropkick.png?fd27f7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Dropkick.png/300px-Beta-Red-Dropkick.png?fd27f7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dropkick" title="Dropkick">Dropkick</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 5 damage.<br />If the enemy has <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>, gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 8 damage.<br />If the enemy has <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>, gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Dual Wield" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dual_Wield" title="Dual Wield"><img alt="Red-DualWield.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DualWield.png/150px-Red-DualWield.png?40468c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DualWield.png/225px-Red-DualWield.png?40468c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DualWield.png/300px-Red-DualWield.png?40468c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dual_Wield" title="Dual Wield"><img alt="Red-DualWieldPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DualWieldPlus.png/150px-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?79d2f6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DualWieldPlus.png/225px-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?79d2f6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DualWieldPlus.png/300px-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?79d2f6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dual_Wield" title="Dual Wield"><img alt="Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?c08f6e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?c08f6e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-DualWieldPlus.png?c08f6e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dual_Wield" title="Dual Wield"><img alt="Beta-Red-DualWield.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWield.png/150px-Beta-Red-DualWield.png?aaeb38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWield.png/225px-Beta-Red-DualWield.png?aaeb38 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-DualWield.png/300px-Beta-Red-DualWield.png?aaeb38 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dual_Wield" title="Dual Wield">Dual Wield</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Choose an Attack or Power card. Add a copy of that card into your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Choose an Attack or Power card. Add 2 copies of that card into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Entrench" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Block"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Entrench" title="Entrench"><img alt="Red-Entrench.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Entrench.png/150px-Red-Entrench.png?ac918a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Entrench.png/225px-Red-Entrench.png?ac918a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Entrench.png/300px-Red-Entrench.png?ac918a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Entrench" title="Entrench"><img alt="Red-EntrenchPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-EntrenchPlus.png/150px-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?34fdcf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-EntrenchPlus.png/225px-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?34fdcf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-EntrenchPlus.png/300px-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?34fdcf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Entrench" title="Entrench"><img alt="Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?492d0b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?492d0b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-EntrenchPlus.png?492d0b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Entrench" title="Entrench"><img alt="Beta-Red-Entrench.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Entrench.png/150px-Beta-Red-Entrench.png?f47675" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Entrench.png/225px-Beta-Red-Entrench.png?f47675 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Entrench.png/300px-Beta-Red-Entrench.png?f47675 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Entrench" title="Entrench">Entrench</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Double your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Double your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Evolve" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Evolve"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="Red-Evolve.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Evolve.png/150px-Red-Evolve.png?badbb8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Evolve.png/225px-Red-Evolve.png?badbb8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Evolve.png/300px-Red-Evolve.png?badbb8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="Red-EvolvePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-EvolvePlus.png/150px-Red-EvolvePlus.png?eb92b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-EvolvePlus.png/225px-Red-EvolvePlus.png?eb92b2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-EvolvePlus.png/300px-Red-EvolvePlus.png?eb92b2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png?db6c16" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png?db6c16 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-EvolvePlus.png?db6c16 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="Beta-Red-Evolve.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Evolve.png/150px-Beta-Red-Evolve.png?c9e950" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Evolve.png/225px-Beta-Red-Evolve.png?c9e950 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Evolve.png/300px-Beta-Red-Evolve.png?c9e950 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve">Evolve</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Ironclad - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever you draw a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?"><span>Status</span></a></span> card, draw 1 card.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever you draw a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?"><span>Status</span></a></span> card, draw 2 cards.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Feel No Pain" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Feel_No_Pain" title="Feel No Pain"><img alt="Red-FeelNoPain.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPain.png/150px-Red-FeelNoPain.png?d1d65d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPain.png/225px-Red-FeelNoPain.png?d1d65d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPain.png/300px-Red-FeelNoPain.png?d1d65d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Feel_No_Pain" title="Feel No Pain"><img alt="Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/150px-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?8d4525" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/225px-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?8d4525 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/300px-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?8d4525 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Feel_No_Pain" title="Feel No Pain"><img alt="Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?a792c3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?a792c3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPainPlus.png?a792c3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Feel_No_Pain" title="Feel No Pain"><img alt="Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png/150px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png?f79c71" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png/225px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png?f79c71 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png/300px-Beta-Red-FeelNoPain.png?f79c71 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Feel_No_Pain" title="Feel No Pain">Feel No Pain</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Ironclad - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>,<br />gain 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>,<br />gain 4 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Fire Breathing" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Fire Breathing"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing"><img alt="Red-FireBreathing.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FireBreathing.png/150px-Red-FireBreathing.png?3ca842" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FireBreathing.png/225px-Red-FireBreathing.png?3ca842 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FireBreathing.png/300px-Red-FireBreathing.png?3ca842 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing"><img alt="Red-FireBreathingPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/150px-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?51c801" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/225px-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?51c801 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/300px-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?51c801 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing"><img alt="Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?c83b02" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?c83b02 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-FireBreathingPlus.png?c83b02 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing"><img alt="Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png/150px-Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png?c53c50" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png/225px-Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png?c53c50 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png/300px-Beta-Red-FireBreathing.png?c53c50 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing">Fire Breathing</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Ironclad - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever you draw a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Status"><span>Status</span></a></span> or <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> card, deal 6 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever you draw a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Status"><span>Status</span></a></span> or <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span> card, deal 10 damage to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Flame Barrier" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Flame Barrier"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Flame_Barrier" title="Flame Barrier"><img alt="Red-FlameBarrier.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrier.png/150px-Red-FlameBarrier.png?e9949f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrier.png/225px-Red-FlameBarrier.png?e9949f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrier.png/300px-Red-FlameBarrier.png?e9949f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flame_Barrier" title="Flame Barrier"><img alt="Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/150px-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?60388f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/225px-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?60388f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/300px-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?60388f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flame_Barrier" title="Flame Barrier"><img alt="Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?a8a57b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?a8a57b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrierPlus.png?a8a57b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flame_Barrier" title="Flame Barrier"><img alt="Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png/150px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png?3ea505" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png/225px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png?3ea505 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png/300px-Beta-Red-FlameBarrier.png?3ea505 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Flame_Barrier" title="Flame Barrier">Flame Barrier</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 12 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Whenever you are attacked this turn, deal 4 damage back.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 16 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Whenever you are attacked this turn, deal 6 damage back.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Ghostly Armor" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Ethereal"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ghostly_Armor" title="Ghostly Armor"><img alt="Red-GhostlyArmor.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmor.png/150px-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?80a480" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmor.png/225px-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?80a480 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmor.png/300px-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?80a480 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ghostly_Armor" title="Ghostly Armor"><img alt="Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/150px-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?ec5c4e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/225px-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?ec5c4e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/300px-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?ec5c4e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ghostly_Armor" title="Ghostly Armor"><img alt="Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?3ca2c3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?3ca2c3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmorPlus.png?3ca2c3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ghostly_Armor" title="Ghostly Armor"><img alt="Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png/150px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?dc6749" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png/225px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?dc6749 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png/300px-Beta-Red-GhostlyArmor.png?dc6749 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ghostly_Armor" title="Ghostly Armor">Ghostly Armor</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ethereal" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Ethereal" title="Keywords">Ethereal</a></span>.<br />Gain 10 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" he