ext"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Pummel" title="Pummel">Pummel</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 2 damage 4 times.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 2 damage 5 times.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Rage" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Rage"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Rage" title="Rage"><img alt="Red-Rage.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Rage.png/150px-Red-Rage.png?9cb6c3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Rage.png/225px-Red-Rage.png?9cb6c3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Rage.png/300px-Red-Rage.png?9cb6c3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rage" title="Rage"><img alt="Red-RagePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-RagePlus.png/150px-Red-RagePlus.png?414b41" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-RagePlus.png/225px-Red-RagePlus.png?414b41 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-RagePlus.png/300px-Red-RagePlus.png?414b41 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rage" title="Rage"><img alt="Beta-Red-RagePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RagePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-RagePlus.png?e7fffa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RagePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-RagePlus.png?e7fffa 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-RagePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-RagePlus.png?e7fffa 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rage" title="Rage"><img alt="Beta-Red-Rage.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rage.png/150px-Beta-Red-Rage.png?603aee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rage.png/225px-Beta-Red-Rage.png?603aee 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rage.png/300px-Beta-Red-Rage.png?603aee 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Rage" title="Rage">Rage</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever you play an Attack this turn, gain 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever you play an Attack this turn, gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Rampage" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Rampage" title="Rampage"><img alt="Red-Rampage.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Rampage.png/150px-Red-Rampage.png?83c898" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Rampage.png/225px-Red-Rampage.png?83c898 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Rampage.png/300px-Red-Rampage.png?83c898 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rampage" title="Rampage"><img alt="Red-RampagePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-RampagePlus.png/150px-Red-RampagePlus.png?697fa1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-RampagePlus.png/225px-Red-RampagePlus.png?697fa1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-RampagePlus.png/300px-Red-RampagePlus.png?697fa1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rampage" title="Rampage"><img alt="Beta-Red-RampagePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RampagePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-RampagePlus.png?2e6541" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RampagePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-RampagePlus.png