ata-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reckless_Charge" title="Reckless Charge"><img alt="Red-RecklessChargePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/150px-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?d12cfe" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/225px-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?d12cfe 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/300px-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?d12cfe 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reckless_Charge" title="Reckless Charge"><img alt="Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?b1e00b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?b1e00b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-RecklessChargePlus.png?b1e00b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reckless_Charge" title="Reckless Charge"><img alt="Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png/150px-Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png?6be98d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png/225px-Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png?6be98d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png/300px-Beta-Red-RecklessCharge.png?6be98d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Reckless_Charge" title="Reckless Charge">Reckless Charge</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 7 damage.<br />Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dazed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dazed" title="Dazed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dazed" title="Dazed">Dazed</a></span> into your draw pile.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 10 damage.<br />Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dazed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dazed" title="Dazed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dazed" title="Dazed">Dazed</a></span> into your draw pile.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Rupture" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Lose HP Rupture Strength"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture"><img alt="Red-Rupture.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Rupture.png/150px-Red-Rupture.png?814e2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Rupture.png/225px-Red-Rupture.png?814e2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Rupture.png/300px-Red-Rupture.png?814e2d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture"><img alt="Red-RupturePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-RupturePlus.png/150px-Red-RupturePlus.png?5434bd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-RupturePlus.png/225px-Red-RupturePlus.png?5434bd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-RupturePlus.png/300px-Red-RupturePlus.png?5434bd 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture"><img alt="Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png?b71bd8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png?b71bd8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-RupturePlus.png?b71bd8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture"><img alt="Beta-Red-Rupture.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rupture.png/150px-Beta-Red-Rupture.png?f4ff49" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rupture.png/225px-Beta-Red-Rupture.png?f4ff49 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Rupture.png/300px-Beta-Red-Rupture.png?f4ff49 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Rupture" title="Rupture">Rupture</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Ironclad - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever you lose HP from a card,<br />gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever you lose HP from a card,<br />gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Searing Blow" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Searing_Blow" title="Searing Blow"><img alt="Red-SearingBlow.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SearingBlow.png/150px-Red-SearingBlow.png?82c53c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SearingBlow.png/225px-Red-SearingBlow.png?82c53c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SearingBlow.png/300px-Red-SearingBlow.png?82c53c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Searing_Blow" title="Searing Blow"><img alt="Red-SearingBlowPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/150px-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?6c7f4e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/225px-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?6c7f4e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/300px-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?6c7f4e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Searing_Blow" title="Searing Blow"><img alt="Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?9e2c1d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?9e2c1d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-SearingBlowPlus.png?9e2c1d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Searing_Blow" title="Searing Blow"><img alt="Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png/150px-Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png?d0b564" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png/225px-Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png?d0b564 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png/300px-Beta-Red-SearingBlow.png?d0b564 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Searing_Blow" title="Searing Blow">Searing Blow</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Ironclad - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 12 damage.<br />Can be <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgraded</a></span> any number of times.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 16 damage.<br />Can be <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgraded</a></span> any number of times.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Second Wind" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Exhaust Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Second_Wind" title="Second Wind"><img alt="Red-SecondWind.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SecondWind.png/150px-Red-SecondWind.png?f324d6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SecondWind.png/225px-Red-SecondWind.png?f324d6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SecondWind.png/300px-Red-SecondWind.png?f324d6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Second_Wind" title="Second Wind"><img alt="Red-SecondWindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SecondWindPlus.png/150px-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?e6107b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SecondWindPlus.png/225px-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?e6107b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SecondWindPlus.png/300px-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?e6107b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Second_Wind" title="Second Wind"><img alt="Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?c4258b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?c4258b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-SecondWindPlus.png?c4258b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Second_Wind" title="Second Wind"><img alt="Beta-Red-SecondWind.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWind.png/150px-Beta-Red-SecondWind.png?ec320d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWind.png/225px-Beta-Red-SecondWind.png?ec320d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-SecondWind.png/300px-Beta-Red-SecondWind.png?ec320d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Second_Wind" title="Second Wind">Second Wind</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span> all non-Attack cards in your hand. Gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> for each card <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span> all non-Attack cards in your hand. Gain 7 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> for each card <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Seeing Red" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Energy Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Seeing_Red" title="Seeing Red"><img alt="Red-SeeingRed.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SeeingRed.png/150px-Red-SeeingRed.png?3ad3df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SeeingRed.png/225px-Red-SeeingRed.png?3ad3df 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SeeingRed.png/300px-Red-SeeingRed.png?3ad3df 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Seeing_Red" title="Seeing Red"><img alt="Red-SeeingRedPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SeeingRedPlus.png/150px-Red-SeeingRedPlus.png?6b252a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SeeingRedPlus.png/225px-Red-SeeingRedPlus.png?6b252a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SeeingRedPlus.png/300px-Red-SeeingRedPlus.png?6b252a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" st