0a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Sentinel" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Energy Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sentinel" title="Sentinel"><img alt="Red-Sentinel.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-Sentinel.png/150px-Red-Sentinel.png?348fc7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-Sentinel.png/225px-Red-Sentinel.png?348fc7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-Sentinel.png/300px-Red-Sentinel.png?348fc7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Sentinel" title="Sentinel"><img alt="Red-SentinelPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-SentinelPlus.png/150px-Red-SentinelPlus.png?9dd76f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-SentinelPlus.png/225px-Red-SentinelPlus.png?9dd76f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-SentinelPlus.png/300px-Red-SentinelPlus.png?9dd76f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Sentinel" title="Sentinel"><img alt="Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png/150px-Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png?e442f4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png/225px-Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png?e442f4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png/300px-Beta-Red-SentinelPlus.png?e442f4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Sentinel" title="Sentinel"><img alt="Beta-Red-Sentinel.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Sentinel.png/150px-Beta-Red-Sentinel.png?763c3e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Red-Sentinel.png/225px-Beta-Red-Sentinel.png?763c3e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Red-Sentinel.png/300px-Beta-Red-Sentinel.png?763c3e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Sentinel" title="Sentinel">Sentinel</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Red" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Ironclad - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />If this card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhausted</span></a></span>,<br />gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span><span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 8 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-he