h">Strength</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the start of your turn, gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Double Tap" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Red" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Double_Tap" title="Double Tap"><img alt="Red-DoubleTap.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DoubleTap.png/150px-Red-DoubleTap.png?bdd1b1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DoubleTap.png/225px-Red-DoubleTap.png?bdd1b1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DoubleTap.png/300px-Red-DoubleTap.png?bdd1b1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Double_Tap" title="Double Tap"><img alt="Red-DoubleTapPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Red-DoubleTapPlus.png/150px-Red-DoubleTapPlus.png?7769d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Red-DoubleTapPlus.png/225px-Red-DoubleTapPlus.png?7769d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Red-DoubleTapPlus.png/300px-Red-DoubleTapPlus.png?7769d1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-bet