data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> is not removed at the start of your next turn.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Bouncing Flask" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Poison"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bouncing_Flask" title="Bouncing Flask"><img alt="Green-BouncingFlask.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlask.png/150px-Green-BouncingFlask.png?2c26a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlask.png/225px-Green-BouncingFlask.png?2c26a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlask.png/300px-Green-BouncingFlask.png?2c26a5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bouncing_Flask" title="Bouncing Flask"><img alt="Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png/150px-Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png?60bff7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png/225px-Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png?60bff7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png/300px-Green-BouncingFlaskPlus.png?60bff7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display: