ng?63126b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Expertise" title="Expertise">Expertise</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Green" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Silent - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Draw cards until you have 6 in your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Draw cards until you have 7 in your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Finisher" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Finisher" title="Finisher"><img alt="Green-Finisher.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-Finisher.png/150px-Green-Finisher.png?f23449" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-Finisher.png/225px-Green-Finisher.png?f23449 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-Finisher.png/300px-Green-Finisher.png?f23449 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Finisher" title="Finisher"><img alt="Green-FinisherPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-FinisherPlus.png/150px-Green-FinisherPlus.png?a2bf18" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-FinisherPlus.png/225px-Green-FinisherPlus.png?a2bf18 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-FinisherPlus.png/300px-Green-FinisherPlus.png?a2bf18 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Finisher" title="Finisher"><img alt="Beta-Green-FinisherPlu