k">Uncommon - Silent - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 4 damage for each Skill in your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 6 damage for each Skill in your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Footwork" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Dexterity"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Footwork" title="Footwork"><img alt="Green-Footwork.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-Footwork.png/150px-Green-Footwork.png?eecced" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-Footwork.png/225px-Green-Footwork.png?eecced 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-Footwork.png/300px-Green-Footwork.png?eecced 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Footwork" title="Footwork"><img alt="Green-FootworkPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-FootworkPlus.png/150px-Green-FootworkPlus.png?90c35e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-FootworkPlus.png/225px-Green-FootworkPlus.png?90c35e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-FootworkPlus.png/300px-Green-FootworkPlus.png?90c35e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Footwork" title="Footwork"><img alt="Beta-Green-FootworkPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-FootworkPlus.png/150px-Beta-Green-FootworkPlus.png?335cf2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-FootworkPlus.png/225px-Beta-Green-FootworkPlus.png?335cf2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Green-Footw