 <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Heel Hook" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Energy Weak"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Heel_Hook" title="Heel Hook"><img alt="Green-HeelHook.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-HeelHook.png/150px-Green-HeelHook.png?c4924c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-HeelHook.png/225px-Green-HeelHook.png?c4924c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-HeelHook.png/300px-Green-HeelHook.png?c4924c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Heel_Hook" title="Heel Hook"><img alt="Green-HeelHookPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-HeelHookPlus.png/150px-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?3c170c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-HeelHookPlus.png/225px-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?3c170c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-HeelHookPlus.png/300px-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?3c170c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Heel_Hook" title="Heel Hook"><img alt="Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png/150px-Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?ac9666" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png/225px-Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?ac9666 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png/300px-Beta-Green-HeelHookPlus.png?ac9666 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Heel_Hook" title="Heel Hook"><img alt="Beta-Green-HeelHook.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHook.png/150px-Beta-Green-HeelHook.png?80d059" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHook.png/225px-Beta-Green-HeelHook.png?80d059 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Green-HeelHook.png/300px-Beta-Green-HeelHook.png?80d059 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Heel_Hook" title="Heel Hook">Heel Hook</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Green" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Silent - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 5 damage. <br />If the enemy has <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>, <br />gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 8 damage. <br />If the enemy has <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>, <br />gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Infinite Blades" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Infinite_Blades" title="Infinite Blades"><img alt="Green-InfiniteBlades.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-InfiniteBlades.png/150px-Green-InfiniteBlades.png?d8c7a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-InfiniteBlades.png/225px-Green-InfiniteBlades.png?d8c7a6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-InfiniteBlades.png/300px-Green-InfiniteBlades.png?d8c7a6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Infinite_Blades" title="Infinite Blades"><img alt="Green-InfiniteBladesPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-InfiniteBladesPlus.png/150px-Green-InfiniteBladesPlus.png?897c49" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193"