sterfulStab.png/150px-Beta-Green-MasterfulStab.png?fd18d2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-MasterfulStab.png/225px-Beta-Green-MasterfulStab.png?fd18d2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Green-MasterfulStab.png/300px-Beta-Green-MasterfulStab.png?fd18d2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Masterful_Stab" title="Masterful Stab">Masterful Stab</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Green" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Silent - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Costs 1 additional <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> for each time you lose HP this combat.<br />Deal 12 damage.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Costs 1 additional <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> for each time you lose HP this combat.<br />Deal 16 damage.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box