ywords">Retain</a></span> up to 1 card.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the end of your turn, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span> up to 2 cards.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="A Thousand Cuts" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/A_Thousand_Cuts" title="A Thousand Cuts"><img alt="Green-AThousandCuts.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-AThousandCuts.png/150px-Green-AThousandCuts.png?898a62" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-AThousandCuts.png/225px-Green-AThousandCuts.png?898a62 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-AThousandCuts.png/300px-Green-AThousandCuts.png?898a62 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/A_Thousand_Cuts" title="A Thousand Cuts"><img alt="Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png/150px-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png?77718e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png/225px-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png?77718e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png/300px-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png?77718e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/A_Thousand_Cuts" title="A Thousand Cuts"><img alt="Beta-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png/150px-Beta-Green-AThousandCutsPlus.png?702ea4" decoding="async