Silent - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.<br />Draw 2 cards.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.<br />Draw 2 cards.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art<