ison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span>.<br />When the enemy dies, deal damage equal to its max HP to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Apply 9 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span>.<br />When the enemy dies, deal damage equal to its max HP to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Die Die Die" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Die_Die_Die" title="Die Die Die"><img alt="Green-DieDieDie.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-DieDieDie.png/150px-Green-DieDieDie.png?eb3b93" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-DieDieDie.png/225px-Green-DieDieDie.png?eb3b93 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-DieDieDie.png/300px-Green-DieDieDie.png?eb3b93 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Die_Die_Die" title="Die Die Die"><img alt="Green-DieDieDiePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-DieDieDiePlus.png/150px-Green-DieDieDiePlus.png?827