ords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Choose a card.<br />Next turn, add 3 copies of that card into your hand. <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Phantasmal Killer" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Green" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Phantasmal_Killer" title="Phantasmal Killer"><img alt="Green-PhantasmalKiller.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKiller.png/150px-Green-PhantasmalKiller.png?a66846" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKiller.png/225px-Green-PhantasmalKiller.png?a66846 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKiller.png/300px-Green-PhantasmalKiller.png?a66846 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Phantasmal_Killer" title="Phantasmal Killer"><img alt="Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png/150px-Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png?3abb36" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png/225px-Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png?3abb36 1.5x, /images/thumb/Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png/300px-Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png?3abb36 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Phantasmal_Killer" title="Phantasmal Killer"><img alt="Beta-Green-PhantasmalKillerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Green-Ph