><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 3 damage.<br />Apply 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 4 damage.<br />Apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Charge Battery" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Energy"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery"><img alt="Blue-ChargeBattery.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBattery.png/150px-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?918d86" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBattery.png/225px-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?918d86 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBattery.png/300px-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?918d86 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery"><img alt="Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/150px-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?b35c39" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/225px-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?b35c39 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/300px-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?b35c39 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery"><img alt="Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?f9c539" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?f9c539 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBatteryPlus.png?f9c539 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery"><img alt="Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png/150px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?115597" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png/225px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?115597 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png/300px-Beta-Blue-ChargeBattery.png?115597 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery">Charge Battery</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-ra