ger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channeled</span></a></span> this combat to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal damage equal to 3 times the number of <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frost" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><img alt="FrostOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/18px-FrostOrb.png?213701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/27px-FrostOrb.png?213701 1.5x, /images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/36px-FrostOrb.png?213701 2x" data-file-width="71" data-file-height="71" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><span title="">Frost</span></a></span> <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channeled</span></a></span> this combat to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Boot Sequence" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Exhaust Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Boot_Sequence" title="Boot Sequence"><img alt="Blue-BootSequence.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-BootSequence.png/150px-Blue-BootSequence.png?e2101e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-BootSequence.png/225px-Blue-BootSequence.png?e2101e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-BootSequence.png/300px-Blue-BootSequence.png?e2101e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Boot_Sequence" title="Boot Sequence"><img alt="Blue-BootSequencePlus.png" 