"Overclock"><img alt="Blue-OverclockPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-OverclockPlus.png/150px-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?9d93a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-OverclockPlus.png/225px-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?9d93a0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-OverclockPlus.png/300px-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?9d93a0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Overclock" title="Overclock"><img alt="Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?84e8fb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?84e8fb 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-OverclockPlus.png?84e8fb 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Overclock" title="Overclock"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Overclock.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Overclock.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Overclock.png?29795a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Overclock.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Overclock.png?29795a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Overclock.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Overclock.png?29795a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Overclock" title="Overclock">Overclock</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Draw 2 cards.<br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Burn" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn">Burn</a></span> into your discard pile.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Draw 3 cards.<br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Burn" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn">Burn</a></span> into your discard pile.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Recycle" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Energy Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Recycle" title="Recycle"><img alt="Blue-Recycle.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Recycle.png/150px-Blue-Recycle.png?80e23f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Recycle.png/225px-Blue-Recycle.png?80e23f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Recycle.png/300px-Blue-Recycle.png?80e23f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Recycle" title="Recycle"><img alt="Blue-RecyclePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-RecyclePlus.png/150px-Blue-RecyclePlus.png?14a675" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-RecyclePlus.png/225px-Blue-RecyclePlus.png?14a675 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-RecyclePlu