"card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 7 damage.<br />Draw 4 cards.<br />Discard all cards drawn this way that do not cost 0.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 10 damage.<br />Draw 5 cards.<br />Discard all cards drawn this way that do not cost 0.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Self Repair" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Self_Repair" title="Self Repair"><img alt="Blue-SelfRepair.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepair.png/150px-Blue-SelfRepair.png?6d5701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepair.png/225px-Blue-SelfRepair.png?6d5701 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepair.png/300px-Blue-SelfRepair.png?6d5701 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Self_Repair" title="Self Repair"><img alt="Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png/150px-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png?811307" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png/225px-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png?811307 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png/300px-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png?811307 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Self_Repair" title="Self Repair"><img alt="Beta-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-SelfRepairPlus.png?312449" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-SelfRepairPlus