n>Power</span></a></span> card, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Sunder" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Energy"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Sunder" title="Sunder"><img alt="Blue-Sunder.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Sunder.png/150px-Blue-Sunder.png?e73147" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Sunder.png/225px-Blue-Sunder.png?e73147 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Sunder.png/300px-Blue-Sunder.png?e73147 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Sunder" title="Sunder"><img alt="Blue-SunderPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-SunderPlus.png/150px-Blue-SunderPlus.png?e4b68d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-SunderPlus.png/225px-Blue-SunderPlus.png?e4b68d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-SunderPlus.png/300px-Blue-SunderPlus.png?e4b68d 2x" data-file