ical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 32 damage.<br />If this kills an enemy, gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.</div></div>