" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-BiasedCognition.png/225px-Blue-BiasedCognition.png?7feea1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-BiasedCognition.png/300px-Blue-BiasedCognition.png?7feea1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition"><img alt="Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/150px-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?6d56a1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/225px-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?6d56a1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/300px-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?6d56a1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition"><img alt="Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?737fec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?737fec 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognitionPlus.png?737fec 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition"><img alt="Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png/150px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png?c69cde" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png/225px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png?c69cde 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png/300px-Beta-Blue-BiasedCognition.png?c69cde 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition">Biased Cognition</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Power">Rare - Defect - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.<br />At the start of your turn, lose 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 5 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.<br />At the start of your turn, lose 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus