" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 15 damage.<br />Gain 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Creative AI" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Creative_AI" title="Creative AI"><img alt="Blue-CreativeAI.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-CreativeAI.png/150px-Blue-CreativeAI.png?aadc93" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-CreativeAI.png/225px-Blue-CreativeAI.png?aadc93 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Creat