eta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fission" title="Fission"><img alt="Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png?c7e029" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png?c7e029 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-FissionPlus.png?c7e029 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fission" title="Fission"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Fission.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Fission.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Fission.png?9dcd0e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Fission.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Fission.png?9dcd0e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Fission.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Fission.png?9dcd0e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fission" title="Fission">Fission</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Rare - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Remove all your Orbs. Gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card for each Orb removed.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evoke" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Evoke</span></a></span> all your Orbs. Gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> and draw 1 card for each Orb <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evoke" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Evoked</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Hyperbeam" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Focus"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Hyperbeam" title="Hyperbeam"><img alt="Blue-Hyperbeam.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Hyperbeam.png/150px-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?b36ad7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Hyperbeam.png/225px-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?b36ad7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Hyperbeam.png/300px-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?b36ad7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Hyperbeam" title="Hyperbeam"><img alt="Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/150px-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?12fac1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/225px-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?12fac1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/300px-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?12fac1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Hyperbeam" title="Hyperbeam"><img alt="Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?a42a2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?a42a2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-HyperbeamPlus.png?a42a2d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Hyperbeam" title="Hyperbeam"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?bfb0f3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?bfb0f3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Hyperbeam.png?bfb0f3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Hyperbeam" title="Hyperbeam">Hyperbeam</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Attack">Rare - Defect - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 26 damage to ALL enemies.<br />Lose 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 34 damage to ALL enemies.<br />Lose 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Machine Learning" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Machine_Learning" title="Machine Learning"><img alt="Blue-MachineLearning.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-MachineLearning.png/150px-Blue-MachineLearning.png?9525ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-MachineLearning.png/225px-Blue-MachineLearning.png?9525ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-MachineLearning.png/300px-Blue-MachineLearning.png?9525ac 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Machine_Learning" title="Machine Learning"><img alt="Blue-MachineLearningPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-MachineLearningPlus.png/150px-Blue-MachineLearningPlus.png?b853ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-MachineLearningPlus.png/225px-Blue-MachineLearningP