upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Meteor Strike" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="5" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Channel Plasma"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Meteor_Strike" title="Meteor Strike"><img alt="Blue-MeteorStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrike.png/150px-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?10a424" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrike.png/225px-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?10a424 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrike.png/300px-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?10a424 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meteor_Strike" title="Meteor Strike"><img alt="Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/150px-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?10fa14" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/225px-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?10fa14 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/300px-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?10fa14 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meteor_Strike" title="Meteor Strike"><img alt="Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?6f0abe" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?6f0abe 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrikePlus.png?6f0abe 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meteor_Strike" title="Meteor Strike"><img alt="Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png/150px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?d9a3ff" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png/225px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?d9a3ff 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png/300px-Beta-Blue-MeteorStrike.png?d9a3ff 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Meteor_Strike" title="Meteor Strike">Meteor Strike</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Attack">Rare - Defect - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 24 damage. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plasma" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><img alt="PlasmaOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/18px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/27px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 1.5x, /images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/36px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><span title="">Plasma</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 30 damage. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 3 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plasma" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><img alt="PlasmaOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/18px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/27px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 1.5x, /images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/36px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><span title="">Plasma</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Multi-Cast" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="X" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Evoke"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Multi-Cast" title="Multi-Cast"><img alt="Blue-Multi-Cast.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Multi-Cast.png/150px-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?386ff2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Multi-Cast.png/225px-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?386ff2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Multi-Cast.png/300px-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?386ff2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Multi-Cast" title="Multi-Cast"><img alt="Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/150px-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?1f7c10" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/225px-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?1f7c10 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/300px-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?1f7c10 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Multi-Cast" title="Multi-Cast"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?348aa1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?348aa1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Multi-CastPlus.png?348aa1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Multi-Cast" title="Multi-Cast"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?10057d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?10057d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Multi-Cast.png?10057d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Multi-Cast" title="Multi-Cast">Multi-Cast</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Rare - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evoke" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Evoke</span></a></span> your next Orb X times.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evoke" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Evoke</span></a></span> your next Orb X+1 times.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Rainbow" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Channel Dark Exhaust Frost Lightning"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Rainbow" title="Rainbow"><img alt="Blue-Rainbow.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Rainbow.png/150px-Blue-Rainbow.png?946255" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Rainbow.png/225px-Blue-Rainbow.png?946255 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Rainbow.png/300px-Blue-Rainbow.png?946255 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rainbow" title="Rainbow"><img alt="Blue-RainbowPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-RainbowPlus.png/150px-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?617e2a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-RainbowPlus.png/225px-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?617e2a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-RainbowPlus.png/300px-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?617e2a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rainbow" title="Rainbow"><img alt="Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?193c16" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?193c16 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-RainbowPlus.png?193c16 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Rainbow" title="Rainbow"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png?10e02f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png?10e02f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Rainbow.png?10e02f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Rainbow" title="Rainbow">Rainbow</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Rare - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frost" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><img alt="FrostOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/18px-FrostOrb.png?213701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/27px-FrostOrb.png?213701 1.5x, /images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/36px-FrostOrb.png?213701 2x" data-file-width="71" data-file-height="71" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><span title="">Frost</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><img alt="DarkOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/18px-DarkOrb.png?895273" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/27px-DarkOrb.png?895273 1.5x, /images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/36px-DarkOrb.png?895273 2x" data-file-width="82" data-file-height="82" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><span title="">Dark</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Frost" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><img alt="FrostOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/18px-FrostOrb.png?213701" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/27px-FrostOrb.png?213701 1.5x, /images/thumb/FrostOrb.png/36px-FrostOrb.png?213701 2x" data-file-width="71" data-file-height="71" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Frost" title="Frost"><span title="">Frost</span></a></span>.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channel</span></a></span> 1 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><img alt="DarkOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/18px-DarkOrb.png?895273" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/27px-DarkOrb.png?895273 1.5x, /images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/36px-DarkOrb.png?895273 2x" data-file-width="82" data-file-height="82" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><span title="">Dark</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Reboot" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Reboot" title="Reboot"><img alt="Blue-Reboot.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Reboot.png/150px-Blue-Reboot.png?aa3063" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Reboot.png/225px-Blue-Reboot.png?aa3063 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Reboot.png/300px-Blue-Reboot.png?aa3063 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reboot" title="Reboot"><img alt="Blue-RebootPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-RebootPlus.png/150px-Blue-RebootPlus.png?854b39" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-RebootPlus.png/225px-Blue-RebootPlus.png?854b39 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-RebootPlus.png/300px-Blue-RebootPlus.png?854b39 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reboot" title="Reboot"><img alt="Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png?7d8b2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png?7d8b2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-RebootPlus.png?7d8b2d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Reboot" title="Reboot"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Reboot.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Reboot.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Reboot.png?656c4b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Reboot.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Reboot.png?656c4b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Reboot.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Reboot.png?656c4b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Reboot" title="Reboot">Reboot</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Rare - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Shuffle ALL your cards into your draw pile.<br />Draw 4 cards.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Shuffle ALL your cards into your draw pile.<br />Draw 6 cards.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Seek" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek"><img alt="Blue-Seek.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-Seek.png/150px-Blue-Seek.png?1abf25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-Seek.png/225px-Blue-Seek.png?1abf25 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-Seek.png/300px-Blue-Seek.png?1abf25 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek"><img alt="Blue-SeekPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-SeekPlus.png/150px-Blue-SeekPlus.png?36797c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-SeekPlus.png/225px-Blue-SeekPlus.png?36797c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-SeekPlus.png/300px-Blue-SeekPlus.png?36797c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek"><img alt="Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png?1355b3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png?1355b3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-SeekPlus.png?1355b3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek"><img alt="Beta-Blue-Seek.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Seek.png/150px-Beta-Blue-Seek.png?fedea5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Seek.png/225px-Beta-Blue-Seek.png?fedea5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-Seek.png/300px-Beta-Blue-Seek.png?fedea5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek">Seek</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Skill">Rare - Defect - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put 1 card from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put 2 cards from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Thunder Strike" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Blue" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Channel Lightning"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike"><img alt="Blue-ThunderStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrike.png/150px-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?aaaa7f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrike.png/225px-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?aaaa7f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrike.png/300px-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?aaaa7f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike"><img alt="Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/150px-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?11c799" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/225px-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?11c799 1.5x, /images/thumb/Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/300px-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?11c799 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike"><img alt="Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?e7a9d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?e7a9d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrikePlus.png?e7a9d1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike"><img alt="Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png/150px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?9aaae5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png/225px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?9aaae5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png/300px-Beta-Blue-ThunderStrike.png?9aaae5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Thunder_Strike" title="Thunder Strike">Thunder Strike</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Blue" data-type="Attack">Rare - Defect - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 7 damage to a random enemy for each <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span> <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channeled</span></a></span> this combat.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 9 damage to a random enemy for each <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lightning" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><img alt="LightningOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/18px-LightningOrb.png?295517" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/27px-LightningOrb.png?295517 1.5x, /images/thumb/LightningOrb.png/36px-LightningOrb.png?295517 2x" data-file-width="70" data-file-height="70" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lightning" title="Lightning"><span title="">Lightning</span></a></span> <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Channel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><span title="">Channeled</span></a></span> this combat.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Defend (Watcher)" data-rarity="Basic" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Watcher)" title="Defend (Watcher)"><img alt="Purple-Defend.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Defend.png/150px-Purple-Defend.png?716343" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Defend.png/225px-Purple-Defend.png?716343 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Defend.png/300px-Purple-Defend.png?716343 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Watcher)" title="Defend (Watcher)"><img alt="Purple-DefendPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DefendPlus.png/150px-Purple-DefendPlus.png?1997ae" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DefendPlus.png/225px-Purple-DefendPlus.png?1997ae 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DefendPlus.png/300px-Purple-DefendPlus.png?1997ae 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="