ype=Skill"><span>Skill</span></a></span>, apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Cut Through Fate" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Scry"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Cut_Through_Fate" title="Cut Through Fate"><img alt="Purple-CutThroughFate.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFate.png/150px-Purple-CutThroughFate.png?e99475" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFate.png/225px-Purple-CutThroughFate.png?e99475 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFate.png/300px-Purple-CutThroughFate.png?e99475 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Cut_Through_Fate" title="Cut Through Fate"><img alt="Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.png/150px-Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.png?597318" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.png/225px-Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.png?597318 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-CutThroughFatePlus.pn