lock</span></a></span>.<br />Exit your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stance</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Empty Fist" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Stance"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Fist" title="Empty Fist"><img alt="Purple-EmptyFist.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFist.png/150px-Purple-EmptyFist.png?8a55c1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFist.png/225px-Purple-EmptyFist.png?8a55c1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFist.png/300px-Purple-EmptyFist.png?8a55c1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Fist" title="Empty Fist"><img alt="Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/150px-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?e406c5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/225px-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?e406c5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/300px-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?e406c5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Fist" title="Empty Fist"><img alt="Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?928d4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?928d4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFistPlus.png?928d4a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Fist" title="Empty Fist"><img alt="Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png/150px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png?536730" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png/225px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png?536730 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png/300px-Beta-Purple-EmptyFist.png?536730 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Fist" title="Empty Fist">Empty Fist</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Common" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Common - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 9 damage.<br />Exit your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stance</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 14 damage.<br />Exit your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stance</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Evaluate" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Evaluate" title="Evaluate"><img alt="Purple-Evaluate.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Evaluate.png/150px-Purple-Evaluate.png?e06c63" dec