 Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 6 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Shuffle an <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Insight" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Insight" title="Insight"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Insight" title="Insight">Insight</a></span> into your draw pile.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 10 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Shuffle an <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Insight" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Insight" title="Insight"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Insight" title="Insight">Insight</a></span> into your draw pile.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Flurry of Blows" data-rarity="Common" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand Stance"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows" title="Flurry of Blows"><img alt="Purple-FlurryofBlows.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/150px-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?96dcf9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/225px-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?96dcf9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/300px-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?96dcf9 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows" title="Flurry of Blows"><img alt="Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/150px-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?cf144e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/225px-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?cf144e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/300px-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?cf144e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows" title="Flurry of Blows"><img alt="Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?e56dec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?e56dec 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlowsPlus.png?e56dec 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows" title="Flurry of Blows"><img alt="Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/150px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?7be37c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/225px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?7be37c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png/300px-Beta-Purple-FlurryofBlows.png?7be37c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows" title="Flurry of Blows">Flurry of Blows</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Common" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Common - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 4 damage.<br />Whenever you change <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stances</a></span>, return this from the discard pile to your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 6 damage.<br />Whenever you change <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stances</a></span>, return this from the discard pile to your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div>