e-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Battle Hymn" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Hymn" title="Battle Hymn"><img alt="Purple-BattleHymn.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymn.png/150px-Purple-BattleHymn.png?f4a66a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymn.png/225px-Purple-BattleHymn.png?f4a66a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymn.png/300px-Purple-BattleHymn.png?f4a66a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Hymn" title="Battle Hymn"><img alt="Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/150px-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?81e48a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/225px-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?81e48a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/300px-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?81e48a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Hymn" title="Battle Hymn"><img alt="Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?a56dda" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?a56dda 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymnPlus.png?a56dda 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Hymn" title="Battle Hymn"><img alt="Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png/150px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png?4a1b2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png/225px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png?4a1b2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png/300px-Beta-Purple-BattleHymn.png?4a1b2d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Battle_Hymn" title="Battle Hymn">Battle Hymn</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the start of each turn, add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Smite" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite">Smite</a></span> into your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Innate" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Innate" title="Keywords">Innate</a></span>. <br />At the start of each turn, add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Smite" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite">Smite</a></span> into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Carve Reality" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality"><img alt="Purple-CarveReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-CarveReality.png/150px-Purple-CarveReality.png?55452b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-CarveReality.png/225px-Purple-CarveReality.png?55452b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-CarveReality.png/300px-Purple-CarveReality.png?55452b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality"><img alt="Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/150px-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?57797c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/225px-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?57797c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/300px-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?57797c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?67b2df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?67b2df 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-CarveRealityPlus.png?67b2df 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png/150px-Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png?a7e2f7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png/225px-Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png?a7e2f7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png/300px-Beta-Purple-CarveReality.png?a7e2f7 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Carve_Reality" title="Carve Reality">Carve Reality</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 6 damage.<br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Smite" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite">Smite</a></span> into your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 10 damage.<br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Smite" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Smite" title="Smite">Smite</a></span> into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Collect" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="X" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect"><img alt="Purple-Collect.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Collect.png/150px-Purple-Collect.png?66ab93" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Collect.png/225px-Purple-Collect.png?66ab93 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Collect.png/300px-Purple-Collect.png?66ab93 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect"><img alt="Purple-CollectPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-CollectPlus.png/150px-Purple-CollectPlus.png?562abf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-CollectPlus.png/225px-Purple-CollectPlus.png?562abf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-CollectPlus.png/300px-Purple-CollectPlus.png?562abf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect"><img alt="Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png?e4b76b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png?e4b76b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-CollectPlus.png?e4b76b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Collect.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Collect.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Collect.png?52352f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Collect.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Collect.png?52352f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Collect.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Collect.png?52352f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect">Collect</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracle+</a></span> into your hand at the start of your next X turns. <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span></div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracle+</a></span> into your hand at the start of your next X+1 turns. <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span></div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Conclude" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Conclude" title="Conclude"><img alt="Purple-Conclude.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Conclude.png/150px-Purple-Conclude.png?56d588" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Conclude.png/225px-Purple-Conclude.png?56d588 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Conclude.png/300px-Purple-Conclude.png?56d588 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conclude" title="Conclude"><img alt="Purple-ConcludePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ConcludePlus.png/150px-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?f80af1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ConcludePlus.png/225px-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?f80af1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ConcludePlus.png/300px-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?f80af1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conclude" title="Conclude"><img alt="Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?563848" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?563848 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-ConcludePlus.png?563848 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conclude" title="Conclude"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Conclude.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Conclude.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Conclude.png?3e2dbe" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Conclude.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Conclude.png?3e2dbe 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Conclude.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Conclude.png?3e2dbe 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Conclude" title="Conclude">Conclude</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 12 damage to ALL enemies.<br />End your turn.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 16 damage to ALL enemies.<br />End your turn.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Deceive Reality" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Deceive_Reality" title="Deceive Reality"><img alt="Purple-DeceiveReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveReality.png/150px-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?c6d9c6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveReality.png/225px-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?c6d9c6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveReality.png/300px-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?c6d9c6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deceive_Reality" title="Deceive Reality"><img alt="Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/150px-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?63b92b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/225px-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?63b92b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/300px-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?63b92b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deceive_Reality" title="Deceive Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?405f8e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?405f8e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveRealityPlus.png?405f8e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deceive_Reality" title="Deceive Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?26ec36" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?26ec36 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DeceiveReality.png?26ec36 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Deceive_Reality" title="Deceive Reality">Deceive Reality</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 4 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>. <br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Safety" data-sequel="1"></span> into your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 7 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>. <br />Add a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Safety" data-sequel="1"></span> into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Empty Mind" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Stance"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Mind" title="Empty Mind"><img alt="Purple-EmptyMind.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMind.png/150px-Purple-EmptyMind.png?e58da8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMind.png/225px-Purple-EmptyMind.png?e58da8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMind.png/300px-Purple-EmptyMind.png?e58da8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Mind" title="Empty Mind"><img alt="Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/150px-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?8d3560" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/225px-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?8d3560 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/300px-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?8d3560 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Mind" title="Empty Mind"><img alt="Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?e5dd00" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?e5dd00 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMindPlus.png?e5dd00 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Mind" title="Empty Mind"><img alt="Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png/150px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png?2d5fd9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png/225px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png?2d5fd9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png/300px-Beta-Purple-EmptyMind.png?2d5fd9 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Empty_Mind" title="Empty Mind">Empty Mind</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Exit your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stance</a></span>.<br />Draw 2 cards.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Exit your <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stance</a></span>.<br />Draw 3 cards.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Fasting" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Dexterity Strength"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="Purple-Fasting.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Fasting.png/150px-Purple-Fasting.png?d21a38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Fasting.png/225px-Purple-Fasting.png?d21a38 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Fasting.png/300px-Purple-Fasting.png?d21a38 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="Purple-FastingPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-FastingPlus.png/150px-Purple-FastingPlus.png?c56077" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-FastingPlus.png/225px-Purple-FastingPlus.png?c56077 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-FastingPlus.png/300px-Purple-FastingPlus.png?c56077 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png?1a7f55" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png?1a7f55 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-FastingPlus.png?1a7f55 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Fasting.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Fasting.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Fasting.png?2acde1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Fasting.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Fasting.png?2acde1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Fasting.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Fasting.png?2acde1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting">Fasting</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>. <br />Gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>. <br />Gain 1 less <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@PE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="PurpleEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/20px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/30px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/40px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> at the start of each turn.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Gain 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>. <br />Gain 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dexterity" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity"><img alt="Icon Dexterity.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/22px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/33px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Dexterity.png/44px-Icon_Dexterity.png?83caf7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dexterity" title="Dexterity">Dexterity</a></span>. <br />Gain 1 less <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@PE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="PurpleEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/20px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/30px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/40px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> at the start of each turn.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Fear No Evil" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Calm"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Fear_No_Evil" title="Fear No Evil"><img alt="Purple-FearNoEvil.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvil.png/150px-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?52f776" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvil.png/225px-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?52f776 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvil.png/300px-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?52f776 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fear_No_Evil" title="Fear No Evil"><img alt="Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/150px-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?b2561d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/225px-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?b2561d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/300px-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?b2561d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fear_No_Evil" title="Fear No Evil"><img alt="Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?1cee0b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?1cee0b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvilPlus.png?1cee0b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Fear_No_Evil" title="Fear No Evil"><img alt="Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png/150px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?afbd04" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png/225px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?afbd04 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png/300px-Beta-Purple-FearNoEvil.png?afbd04 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Fear_No_Evil" title="Fear No Evil">Fear No Evil</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 8 damage.<br />If the enemy intends to Attack, enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 11 damage.<br />If the enemy intends to Attack, enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Foreign Influence" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Foreign_Influence" title="Foreign Influence"><img alt="Purple-ForeignInfluence.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluence.png/150px-Purple-ForeignInfluence.png?f29133" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluence.png/225px-Purple-ForeignInfluence.png?f29133 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluence.png/300px-Purple-ForeignInfluence.png?f29133 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Foreign_Influence" title="Foreign Influence"><img alt="Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png/150px-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png?1d4f2e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png/225px-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png?1d4f2e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png/300px-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png?1d4f2e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Foreign_Influence" title="Foreign Influence"><img alt="Beta-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png?24613a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-ForeignInfluencePlus.png?24613a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purp