n><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Foresight" title="Foresight">Foresight</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the start of your turn, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span> 3.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the start of your turn, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span> 4.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Indignation" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Vulnerable Wrath"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Indignation" title="Indignation"><img alt="Purple-Indignation.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Indignation.png/150px-Purple-Indignation.png?93ba68" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Indignation.png/225px-Purple-Indignation.png?93ba68 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Indignation.png/300px-Purple-Indignation.png?93ba68 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Indignation" title="Indignation"><img alt="Purple-IndignationPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-IndignationPlus.png/150px-Purple-IndignationPlus.png?38295e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-IndignationPlus.png/225px-Purple-Indignatio