endium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Inner_Peace" title="Inner Peace">Inner Peace</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">If you are in <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>, draw 3 cards,<br />otherwise enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">If you are in <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>, draw 4 cards,<br />otherwise enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Like Water" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Calm"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Like_Water" title="Like Water"><img alt="Purple-LikeWater.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-LikeWater.png/150px-Purple-LikeWater.png?a06552" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-LikeWater.png/225px-Purple-LikeWater.png?a06552 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-LikeWater.png/300px-Purple-LikeWater.png?a06552 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Like_Water" title="Like Water"><img alt="Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/150px-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?c3cee0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/225px-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?c3cee0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/300px-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?c3cee0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Like_Water" title="Like Water"><img alt="Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?9f5f0e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?9f5f0e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-LikeWaterPlus.png?9f5f0e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Like_Water" title="Like Water"><img alt="Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png/150px-Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png?9ec9e0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png/225px-Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png?9ec9e0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png/300px-Beta-Purple-LikeWater.png?9ec9e0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Like_Water" title="Like Water">Like Water</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the end of your turn, if you are in <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>, gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the end of your turn, if you are in <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>, gain 7 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Meditate" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Calm End Turn Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Meditate" title="Meditate"><img alt="Purple-Meditate.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Meditate.png/150px-Purple-Meditate.png?17b574" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Meditate.png/225px-Purple-Meditate.png?17b574 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Meditate.png/300px-Purple-Meditate.png?17b574 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meditate" title="Meditate"><img alt="Purple-MeditatePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-MeditatePlus.png/150px-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?720289" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-MeditatePlus.png/225px-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?720289 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-MeditatePlus.png/300px-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?720289 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meditate" title="Meditate"><img alt="Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?1f2c19" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?1f2c19 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-MeditatePlus.png?1f2c19 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Meditate" title="Meditate"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Meditate.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Meditate.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Meditate.png?47ef3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Meditate.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Meditate.png?47ef3b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Meditate.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Meditate.png?47ef3b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Meditate" title="Meditate">Meditate</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put 1 card from your discard pile into your hand and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span> it.<br />Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.<br />End your turn.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put 2 cards from your discard pile into your hand and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span> them.<br />Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Calm" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Calm</a></span>.<br />End your turn.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Mental Fortress" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Stance"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mental_Fortress" title="Mental Fortress"><img alt="Purple-MentalFortress.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortress.png/150px-Purple-MentalFortress.png?5e2750" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortress.png/225px-Purple-MentalFortress.png?5e2750 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortress.png/300px-Purple-MentalFortress.png?5e2750 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Mental_Fortress" title="Mental Fortress"><img alt="Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/150px-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?ceee59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/225px-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?ceee59 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/300px-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?ceee59 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Mental_Fortress" title="Mental Fortress"><img alt="Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?c6d96d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?c6d96d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortressPlus.png?c6d96d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Mental_Fortress" title="Mental Fortress"><img alt="Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png/150px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png?dd2505" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png/225px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png?dd2505 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png/300px-Beta-Purple-MentalFortress.png?dd2505 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Mental_Fortress" title="Mental Fortress">Mental Fortress</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Uncommon - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever you switch <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Stance" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Stances</a></span>, gain 4 <span cl