 title="Perseverance">Perseverance</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>.<br />Gain 5 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Whenever this card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, increase its <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> by 2.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>.<br />Gain 7 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.<br />Whenever this card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, increase its <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> by 3.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Pray" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Mantra"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Pray" title="Pray"><img alt="Purple-Pray.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Pray.png/150px-Purple-Pray.png?f4aef1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Pray.png/225px-Purple-Pray.png?f4aef1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Pray.png/300px-Purple-Pray.png?f4aef1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Pray" t