="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 4 damage.<br />Whenever you <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span>, return this from the discard pile to your hand.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 6 damage.<br />Whenever you <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Scry" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Scry" title="Keywords">Scry</a></span>, return this from the discard pile to your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Wheel Kick" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Wheel_Kick" title="Wheel Kick"><img alt="Purple-WheelKick.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WheelKick.png/150px-Purple-WheelKick.png?6f48fb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WheelKick.png/225px-Purple-WheelKick.png?6f48fb 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WheelKick.png/300px-Purple-WheelKick.png?6f48fb 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wheel_Kick" title="Wheel Kick"><img alt="Purple-WheelKickPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/150px-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?43e169" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/225px-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?43e169 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/300px-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?43e169 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wheel_Kick" title="Wheel Kick"><img alt="Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?9bab9c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?9bab9c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-WheelKickPlus.png?9bab9c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Wheel_Kick" title="Wheel Kick"><img alt="Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png/150px-Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png?8c0d50" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png/225px-Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png?8c0d50 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png/300px-Beta-Purple-WheelKick.png?8c0d50 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Wheel_Kick" title="Wheel Kick">Wheel Kick</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 15 damage.<br />Draw 2 cards.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 20 damage.<br />Draw 2 cards.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Windmill Strike" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Windmill_Strike" title="Windmill Strike"><img alt="Purple-WindmillStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrike.png/150px-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?289a9a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrike.png/225px-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?289a9a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrike.png/300px-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?289a9a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Windmill_Strike" title="Windmill Strike"><img alt="Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/150px-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?f6a8e2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/225px-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?f6a8e2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/300px-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?f6a8e2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Windmill_Strike" title="Windmill Strike"><img alt="Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?44e682" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?44e682 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrikePlus.png?44e682 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Windmill_Strike" title="Windmill Strike"><img alt="Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png/150px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?d6511a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png/225px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?d6511a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png/300px-Beta-Purple-WindmillStrike.png?d6511a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Windmill_Strike" title="Windmill Strike">Windmill Strike</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Uncommon - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>. <br />Deal 7 damage. <br />When <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, increase its damage by 4 this combat.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>. <br />Deal 10 damage. <br />When <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, increase its damage by 5 this combat.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Worship" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Mantra Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship"><img alt="Purple-Worship.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Worship.png/150px-Purple-Worship.png?753ed3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Worship.png/225px-Purple-Worship.png?753ed3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Worship.png/300px-Purple-Worship.png?753ed3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship"><img alt="Purple-WorshipPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WorshipPlus.png/150px-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?b0ef80" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WorshipPlus.png/225px-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?b0ef80 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WorshipPlus.png/300px-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?b0ef80 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship"><img alt="Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?a572b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?a572b2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-WorshipPlus.png?a572b2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Worship.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Worship.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Worship.png?a94fd4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Worship.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Worship.png?a94fd4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Worship.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Worship.png?a94fd4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship">Worship</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Gain 5 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>.<br />Gain 5 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Wreath of Flame" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Vigor"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Wreath_of_Flame" title="Wreath of Flame"><img alt="Purple-WreathofFlame.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-WreathofFlame.png/150px-Purple-WreathofFlame.png?bdd594" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-WreathofFlame.png/225px-Purple-WreathofFlame.png?bdd594 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-WreathofFlame.png/300px-Purple-WreathofFlame.