ass="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Your next Attack deals 5 additional damage.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Your next Attack deals 8 additional damage.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Alpha" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha"><img alt="Purple-Alpha.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Alpha.png/150px-Purple-Alpha.png?9fcccb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Alpha.png/225px-Purple-Alpha.png?9fcccb 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Alpha.png/300px-Purple-Alpha.png?9fcccb 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha"><img alt="Purple-AlphaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-AlphaPlus.png/150px-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?6df8a2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-AlphaPlus.png/225px-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?6df8a2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-AlphaPlus.png/300px-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?6df8a2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha"><img alt="Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?f5a01e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?f5a01e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-AlphaPlus.png?f5a01e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Alpha.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Alpha.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Alpha.png?d167e8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Alpha.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Alpha.png?d167e8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Alpha.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Alpha.png?d167e8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Alpha" title="Alpha">Alpha</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Beta" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Beta" class="mw-redirect" title="Beta">Beta</a></span> into your draw pile.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Innate" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Innate" title="Keywords">Innate</a></span>. <br />Shuffle a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Beta" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Beta" class="mw-redirect" title="Beta">Beta</a></span> into your draw pile.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Blasphemy" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Blasphemer Divinity Exhaust Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Blasphemy" title="Blasphemy"><img alt="Purple-Blasphemy.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Blasphemy.png/150px-Purple-Blasphemy.png?679c2d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Blasphemy.png/225px-Purple-Blasphemy.png?679c2d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Blasphemy.png/300px-Purple-Blasphemy.png?679c2d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blasphemy" title="Blasphemy"><img alt="Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/150px-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?1a4886" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/225px-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?1a4886 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/300px-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?1a4886 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blasphemy" title="Blasphemy"><img alt="Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?999470" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?999470 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-BlasphemyPlus.png?999470 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blasphemy" title="Blasphemy"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png?defb81" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png?defb81 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Blasphemy.png?defb81 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Blasphemy" title="Blasphemy">Blasphemy</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>.<br />Die next turn.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>.<br />Enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>.<br />Die next turn.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Brilliance" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Mantra"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="Purple-Brilliance.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Brilliance.png/150px-Purple-Brilliance.png?1183f5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Brilliance.png/225px-Purple-Brilliance.png?1183f5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Brilliance.png/300px-Purple-Brilliance.png?1183f5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="Purple-BrilliancePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/150px-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?4d4912" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/225px-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?4d4912 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/300px-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?4d4912 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?c66930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?c66930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-BrilliancePlus.png?c66930 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png?9e81c2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png?9e81c2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Brilliance.png?9e81c2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance">Brilliance</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Rare - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 12 damage.<br />Deals additional damage equal to <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span> gained this combat.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 16 damage.<br />Deals additional damage equal to <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span> gained this combat.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Conjure Blade" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="X" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade"><img alt="Purple-ConjureBlade.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBlade.png/150px-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?6d9061" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBlade.png/225px-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?6d9061 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBlade.png/300px-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?6d9061 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade"><img alt="Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/150px-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?c52666" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/225px-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?c52666 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/300px-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?c52666 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade"><img alt="Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?725fcf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?725fcf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBladePlus.png?725fcf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade"><img alt="Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png/150px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?3f051c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png/225px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?3f051c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png/300px-Beta-Purple-ConjureBlade.png?3f051c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Conjure_Blade" title="Conjure Blade">Conjure Blade</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Shuffle an <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Expunger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Expunger" title="Expunger"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Expunger" class="mw-redirect" title="Expunger">Expunger</a></span> into your draw pile. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Shuffle an <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Expunger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Expunger" title="Expunger"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Attack_Common.png?4d1ee4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Expunger" class="mw-redirect" title="Expunger">Expunger</a></span> with X+1 into your draw pile. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Deus Ex Machina" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="Unplayable" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Exhaust Hand Unplayable"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina"><img alt="Purple-DeusExMachina.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachina.png/150px-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b361b8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachina.png/225px-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b361b8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachina.png/300px-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b361b8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina"><img alt="Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/150px-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?d357ba" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/225px-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?d357ba 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/300px-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?d357ba 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?cb9ca5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?cb9ca5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachinaPlus.png?cb9ca5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b12665" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b12665 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DeusExMachina.png?b12665 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina">Deus Ex Machina</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span>. <br />When you draw this card, add 2 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracles</a></span> to your hand and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span>. <br />When you draw this card, add 3 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracles</a></span> to your hand and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Deva Form" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Ethereal"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Deva_Form" title="Deva Form"><img alt="Purple-DevaForm.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DevaForm.png/150px-Purple-DevaForm.png?da6fcf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DevaForm.png/225px-Purple-DevaForm.png?da6fcf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DevaForm.png/300px-Purple-DevaForm.png?da6fcf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deva_Form" title="Deva Form"><img alt="Purple-DevaFormPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/150px-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?8c4731" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/225px-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?8c4731 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/300px-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?8c4731 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deva_Form" title="Deva Form"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?e3d687" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?e3d687 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DevaFormPlus.png?e3d687 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Deva_Form" title="Deva Form"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png?f85a9a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png?f85a9a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DevaForm.png?f85a9a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Deva_Form" title="Deva Form">Deva Form</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Rare - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ethereal" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Ethereal" title="Keywords">Ethereal</a></span>.<br />At the start of your turn, gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@PE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="PurpleEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/20px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/30px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/40px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <br />and increase this gain by 1.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the start of your turn, gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@PE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="PurpleEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/20px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/30px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/40px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> <br />and increase this gain by 1.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Devotion" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Mantra"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="Purple-Devotion.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Devotion.png/150px-Purple-Devotion.png?e3e0f9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Devotion.png/225px-Purple-Devotion.png?e3e0f9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Devotion.png/300px-Purple-Devotion.png?e3e0f9 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="Purple-DevotionPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-DevotionPlus.png/150px-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?14e660" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-DevotionPlus.png/225px-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?14e660 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-DevotionPlus.png/300px-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?14e660 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?625d3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?625d3b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-DevotionPlus.png?625d3b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Devotion.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Devotion.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Devotion.png?407a0f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Devotion.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Devotion.png?407a0f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Devotion.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Devotion.png?407a0f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion">Devotion</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Rare - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the start of your turn, gain 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the start of your turn, gain 3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs">Mantra</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Establishment" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Innate Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Establishment" title="Establishment"><img alt="Purple-Establishment.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Establishment.png/150px-Purple-Establishment.png?9c0ea0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Establishment.png/225px-Purple-Establishment.png?9c0ea0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Establishment.png/300px-Purple-Establishment.png?9c0ea0 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Establishment" title="Establishment"><img alt="Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/150px-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?28bfa4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/225px-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?28bfa4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/300px-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?28bfa4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Establishment" title="Establishment"><img alt="Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?d76b3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?d76b3b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-EstablishmentPlus.png?d76b3b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Establishment" title="Establishment"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Establishment.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Establishment.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Establishment.png?1050fe" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Establishment.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Establishment.png?1050fe 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Establishment.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Establishment.png?1050fe 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Establishment" title="Establishment">Establishment</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Rare - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, lower its cost by 1.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Innate" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Innate" title="Keywords">Innate</a></span>. Whenever a card is <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retained</a></span>, lower its cost by 1.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Judgment" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Judgment" title="Judgment"><img alt="Purple-Judgment.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Judgment.png/150px-Purple-Judgment.png?85579e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Judgment.png/225px-Purple-Judgment.png?85579e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Judgment.png/300px-Purple-Judgment.png?85579e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Judgment" title="Judgment"><img alt="Purple-JudgmentPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/150px-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?1bc501" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/225px-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?1bc501 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/300px-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?1bc501 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Judgment" title="Judgment"><img alt="Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?466b9a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?466b9a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-JudgmentPlus.png?466b9a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Judgment" title="Judgment"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Judgment.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Judgment.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Judgment.png?7b552b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Judgment.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Judgment.png?7b552b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Judgment.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Judgment.png?7b552b 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Judgment" title="Judgment">Judgment</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">If the enemy has 30 or less HP, set their HP to 0.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">If the enemy has 40 or less HP, set their HP to 0.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Lesson Learned" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Deck Exhaust Fatal Upgrade"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Lesson_Learned" title="Lesson Learned"><img alt="Purple-LessonLearned.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearned.png/150px-Purple-LessonLearned.png?8b684a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearned.png/225px-Purple-LessonLearned.png?8b684a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearned.png/300px-Purple-LessonLearned.png?8b684a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Lesson_Learned" title="Lesson Learned"><img alt="Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/150px-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?473f76" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/225px-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?473f76 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/300px-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?473f76 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Lesson_Learned" title="Lesson Learned"><img alt="Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?ee9a99" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?ee9a99 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearnedPlus.png?ee9a99 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Lesson_Learned" title="Lesson Learned"><img alt="Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png/150px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png?457879" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png/225px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png?457879 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png/300px-Beta-Purple-LessonLearned.png?457879 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Lesson_Learned" title="Lesson Learned">Lesson Learned</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Rare - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 10 damage. <br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> a random card in your deck. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 13 damage. <br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> a random card in your deck. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Master Reality" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Upgrade"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Master_Reality" title="Master Reality"><img alt="Purple-MasterReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-MasterReality.png/150px-Purple-MasterReality.png?5117fd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-MasterReality.png/225px-Purple-MasterReality.png?5117fd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-MasterReality.png/300px-Purple-MasterReality.png?5117fd 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Master_Reality" title="Master Reality"><img alt="Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/150px-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?bb5ec4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/225px-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?bb5ec4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/300px-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?bb5ec4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Master_Reality" title="Master Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?9c21bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?9c21bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-MasterRealityPlus.png?9c21bf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Master_Reality" title="Master Reality"><img alt="Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png/150px-Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png?fc05a2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png/225px-Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png?fc05a2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png/300px-Beta-Purple-MasterReality.png?fc05a2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Master_Reality" title="Master Reality">Master Reality</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Power">Rare - Watcher - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Whenever a card is created during combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> it.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Whenever a card is created during combat, <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgrade</a></span> it.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Omniscience" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="4" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Omniscience" title="Omniscience"><img alt="Purple-Omniscience.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Omniscience.png/150px-Purple-Omniscience.png?2e646c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Omniscience.png/225px-Purple-Omniscience.png?2e646c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Omniscience.png/300px-Purple-Omniscience.png?2e646c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omniscience" title="Omniscience"><img alt="Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/150px-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?795c33" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/225px-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?795c33 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/300px-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?795c33 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omniscience" title="Omniscience"><img alt="Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?324d22" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?324d22 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-OmnisciencePlus.png?324d22 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omniscience" title="Omniscience"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png?fc712d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png?fc712d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Omniscience.png?fc712d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Omniscience" title="Omniscience">Omniscience</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Skill">Rare - Watcher - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Choose a card in your draw pile.<br />Play the chosen card twice and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> it.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Choose a card in your draw pile.<br />Play the chosen card twice and <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span> it.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Ragnarok" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Attack" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok"><img alt="Purple-Ragnarok.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Ragnarok.png/150px-Purple-Ragnarok.png?29b387" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Ragnarok.png/225px-Purple-Ragnarok.png?29b387 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Ragnarok.png/300px-Purple-Ragnarok.png?29b387 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok"><img alt="Purple-RagnarokPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/150px-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?948c85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/225px-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?948c85 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/300px-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?948c85 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok"><img alt="Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/150px-Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?54c2e5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/225px-Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?54c2e5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png/300px-Beta-Purple-RagnarokPlus.png?54c2e5 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok"><img alt="Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png/150px-Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png?8db821" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png/225px-Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png?8db821 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png/300px-Beta-Purple-Ragnarok.png?8db821 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ragnarok" title="Ragnarok">Ragnarok</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Purple" data-type="Attack">Rare - Watcher - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 5 damage to a random enemy 5 times.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 6 damage to a random enemy 6 times.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Scrawl" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Purple" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Scrawl" title="Scrawl"><img alt="Purple-Scrawl.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-Scrawl.png/150px-Purple-Scrawl.png?21626a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-Scrawl.png/225px-Purple-Scrawl.png?21626a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-Scrawl.png/300px-Purple-Scrawl.png?21626a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Scrawl" title="Scrawl"><img alt="Purple-ScrawlPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Purple-ScrawlPlus.png/150px-Purple-ScrawlPlus.png?cbb515" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Purple-ScrawlPlus.png/225px-Purple-ScrawlPlus.png?cbb515 1.5x, /images/thumb/Purple-ScrawlPlus.png/300px-Purple-ScrawlPlus.png?cbb515 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Scrawl" title="Scrawl"><im