es/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>, or 25 Gold. <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Choose one:<br />Gain 8 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plated Armor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor"><img alt="Icon PlatedArmor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/22px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/33px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_PlatedArmor.png/44px-Icon_PlatedArmor.png?647bdc 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plated_Armor" title="Plated Armor">Plated Armor</a></span>, 4 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>, or 30 Gold. <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Bandage Up" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Bandage_Up" title="Bandage Up"><img alt="Colorless-BandageUp.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUp.png/150px-Colorless-BandageUp.png?2a8239" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUp.png/225px-Colorless-BandageUp.png?2a8239 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUp.png/300px-Colorless-BandageUp.png?2a8239 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bandage_Up" title="Bandage Up"><img alt="Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/150px-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?c52056" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/225px-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?c52056 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/300px-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?c52056 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bandage_Up" title="Bandage Up"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?396bdf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?396bdf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUpPlus.png?396bdf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Bandage_Up" title="Bandage Up"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png?5a9280" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png?5a9280 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-BandageUp.png?5a9280 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Bandage_Up" title="Bandage Up">Bandage Up</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Heal 4 HP.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Heal 6 HP.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Blind" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Weak"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Blind" title="Blind"><img alt="Colorless-Blind.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Blind.png/150px-Colorless-Blind.png?77e49f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Blind.png/225px-Colorless-Blind.png?77e49f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Blind.png/300px-Colorless-Blind.png?77e49f 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blind" title="Blind"><img alt="Colorless-BlindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-BlindPlus.png/150px-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?18a591" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-BlindPlus.png/225px-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?18a591 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-BlindPlus.png/300px-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?18a591 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blind" title="Blind"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?173ee2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?173ee2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-BlindPlus.png?173ee2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Blind" title="Blind"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Blind.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Blind.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-Blind.png?2f01ba" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Blind.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-Blind.png?2f01ba 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Blind.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Blind.png?2f01ba 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Blind" title="Blind">Blind</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Apply 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span> to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Strength"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="Colorless-DarkShackles.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShackles.png/150px-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?ac450a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShackles.png/225px-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?ac450a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShackles.png/300px-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?ac450a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/150px-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?179bbf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/225px-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?179bbf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/300px-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?179bbf 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?704681" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?704681 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShacklesPlus.png?704681 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?336353" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?336353 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-DarkShackles.png?336353 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Enemy loses 9 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="