/225px-Beta-Colorless-Forethought.png?88f9ae 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Forethought.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Forethought.png?88f9ae 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Forethought" title="Forethought">Forethought</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put a card from your hand to the bottom of your draw pile. It costs 0 until played.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put any number of cards from your hand to the bottom of your draw pile. They cost 0 until played.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Good Instincts" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Good_Instincts" title="Good Instincts"><img alt="Colorless-GoodInstincts.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-GoodInstincts.png/150px-Colorless-GoodInstincts.png?6c20b1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-GoodInstincts.png/225px-Colorless-GoodInstincts.png?6c20b1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-GoodInstincts.png/300px-Colorless-GoodInstincts.png?6c20b1 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Good_Instincts" title="Good Instincts"><img alt="Colorless-GoodInstinctsPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-GoodInstinctsPlus.png/150px-Colorless-GoodInstinctsPlus.png?501a3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" 