ss</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Uncommon - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Reduce the cost of a random card in your hand to 0 this combat.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Reduce the cost of a random card in your hand to 0 this combat.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Mind Blast" data-rarity="Uncommon" data-type="Attack" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Innate"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Mind_Blast" title="Mind Blast"><img alt="Colorless-MindBlast.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-MindBlast.png/150px-Colorless-MindBlast.png?788154" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-MindBlast.png/225px-Colorless-MindBlast.png?788154 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-MindBlast.png/300px-Colorless-MindBlast.png?788154 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Mind_Blast" title="Mind Blast"><img alt="Colorless-MindBlastPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-MindBlastPlus.png/150px-Colorless-MindBlastPlus.png?9e06f1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-MindBlastPlus.png/225px-Colorless-MindBlastPlus.png?9e06f1 1