c-base">Deal 20 damage.<br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, gain 20 Gold.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 25 damage.<br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, gain 25 Gold.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Magnetism" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Power" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Magnetism" title="Magnetism"><img alt="Colorless-Magnetism.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Magnetism.png/150px-Colorless-Magnetism.png?b03cba" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Magnetism.png/225px-Colorless-Magnetism.png?b03cba 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Magnetism.png/300px-Colorless-Magnetism.png?b03cba 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Magnetism" title="Magnetism"><img alt="Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png/150px-Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png?6671df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png/225px-Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png?6671df 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png/300px-Colorless-MagnetismPlus.png?6671df 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Magnetism" title="Magnetism"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Magnetism