" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretTechnique.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-SecretTechnique.png?a5478e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretTechnique.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-SecretTechnique.png?a5478e 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Technique" title="Secret Technique">Secret Technique</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put a Skill from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put a Skill from your draw pile into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Secret Weapon" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Weapon" title="Secret Weapon"><img alt="Colorless-SecretWeapon.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/150px-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?2dd340" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/225px-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?2dd340 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/300px-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?2dd340 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Weapon" title="Secret Weapon"><img alt="Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/150px-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?e0044c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/225px-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?e0044c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/300px-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?e0044c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Weapon" title="Secret Weapon"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?b74f12" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?b74f12 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeaponPlus.png?b74f12 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Weapon" title="Secret Weapon"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?7f60f2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?7f60f2 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-SecretWeapon.png?7f60f2 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Secret_Weapon" title="Secret Weapon">Secret Weapon</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put an Attack from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put an Attack from your draw pile into your hand.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="The Bomb" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="2" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags=""><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb"><img alt="Colorless-TheBomb.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-TheBomb.png/150px-Colorless-TheBomb.png?c99125" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-TheBomb.png/225px-Colorless-TheBomb.png?c99125 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-TheBomb.png/300px-Colorless-TheBomb.png?c99125 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb"><img alt="Colorless-TheBombPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/150px-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?58187c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/225px-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?58187c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/300px-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?58187c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?52fc85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?52fc85 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-TheBombPlus.png?52fc85 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png?d9da03" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png?d9da03 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-TheBomb.png?d9da03 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/The_Bomb" title="The Bomb">The Bomb</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the end of 3 turns, deal 40 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the end of 3 turns, deal 50 damage to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Thinking Ahead" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Draw Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Thinking_Ahead" title="Thinking Ahead"><img alt="Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/150px-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?bb58d8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/225px-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?bb58d8 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/300px-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?bb58d8 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thinking_Ahead" title="Thinking Ahead"><img alt="Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/150px-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?1c017a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/225px-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?1c017a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/300px-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?1c017a 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thinking_Ahead" title="Thinking Ahead"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?776f9c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?776f9c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAheadPlus.png?776f9c 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Thinking_Ahead" title="Thinking Ahead"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?8712b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?8712b4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-ThinkingAhead.png?8712b4 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Thinking_Ahead" title="Thinking Ahead">Thinking Ahead</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Draw 2 cards.<br />Put a card from your hand on top of your draw pile.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Draw 2 cards.<br />Put a card from your hand on top of your draw pile.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Transmutation" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="false" data-cost="X" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand Upgrade"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Transmutation" title="Transmutation"><img alt="Colorless-Transmutation.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Transmutation.png/150px-Colorless-Transmutation.png?cd42a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Transmutation.png/225px-Colorless-Transmutation.png?cd42a6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Transmutation.png/300px-Colorless-Transmutation.png?cd42a6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Transmutation" title="Transmutation"><img alt="Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png/150px-Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png?677659" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png/225px-Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png?677659 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png/300px-Colorless-TransmutationPlus.png?677659 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Transmutation" title="Transmutation">Transmutation</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Add X random Colorless cards into your hand. They cost 0 this turn.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Add X random <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Upgrade" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Upgrade" title="Upgrade">Upgraded</a></span> Colorless cards into your hand. They cost 0 this turn.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="upgrade-disabled">No Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Violence" data-rarity="Rare" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="0" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Hand"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Violence" title="Violence"><img alt="Colorless-Violence.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Violence.png/150px-Colorless-Violence.png?6d00c9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Violence.png/225px-Colorless-Violence.png?6d00c9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Violence.png/300px-Colorless-Violence.png?6d00c9 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Violence" title="Violence"><img alt="Colorless-ViolencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/150px-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?a0f61d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/225px-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?a0f61d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/300px-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?a0f61d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Violence" title="Violence"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?2612b6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?2612b6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-ViolencePlus.png?2612b6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Violence" title="Violence"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Violence.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Violence.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-Violence.png?85162d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Violence.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-Violence.png?85162d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Violence.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Violence.png?85162d 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Violence" title="Violence">Violence</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Rare" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Rare - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Put 3 random Attacks from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Put 4 random Attacks from your draw pile into your hand.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Burn" data-rarity="Status" data-type="Status" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="Unplayable" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Unplayable"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="Colorless-Burn.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Burn.png/150px-Colorless-Burn.png?7c69e3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Burn.png/225px-Colorless-Burn.png?7c69e3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Burn.png/300px-Colorless-Burn.png?7c69e3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="Colorless-BurnPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-BurnPlus.png/150px-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?af1a81" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-BurnPlus.png/225px-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?af1a81 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-BurnPlus.png/300px-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?af1a81 2x" data-file-width="465" data-file-height="599" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?ba1da9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?ba1da9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-BurnPlus.png?ba1da9 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Burn.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Burn.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-Burn.png?e42b37" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Burn.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-Burn.png?e42b37 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Burn.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Burn.png?e42b37 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Burn" title="Burn">Burn</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Status" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Status">Status - Colorless - Status</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span>.<br />At the end of your turn, take 2 damage.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Unplayable" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Unplayable" title="Keywords">Unplayable</a></span>.<br />At the end of your turn, take 4 damage.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Dazed" data-rarity="Status" data-type="Status" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="false" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="Unplayable" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Ethereal Unplayable"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Dazed" title="Dazed"><img alt="Colorless-Dazed.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Dazed.png/150px-Colorless-Dazed.png?2ab9fb" decoding="async" l