toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Omega" data-rarity="Special" data-type="Power" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="3" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Omega"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Omega" title="Omega"><img alt="Colorless-Omega.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Omega.png/150px-Colorless-Omega.png?a01877" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Omega.png/225px-Colorless-Omega.png?a01877 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Omega.png/300px-Colorless-Omega.png?a01877 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omega" title="Omega"><img alt="Colorless-OmegaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/150px-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?dfe9c6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/225px-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?dfe9c6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/300px-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?dfe9c6 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omega" title="Omega"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?267d53" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?267d53 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-OmegaPlus.png?267d53 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Omega" title="Omega"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Omega.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Omega.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-Omega.png?851940" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Omega.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-Omega.png?851940 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Omega.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Omega.png?851940 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Omega" class="mw-redirect" title="Omega">Omega</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Special" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Power">Special - Colorless - Power</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">At the end of your turn, deal 50 damage to ALL enemies.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">At the end of your turn, deal 60 damage to ALL enemies.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Ritual Dagger" data-rarity="Special" data-type="Attack" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Exhaust Fatal"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Ritual_Dagger" title="Ritual Dagger"><img alt="Colorless-RitualDagger.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDagger.png/150px-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?f7f9db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDagger.png/225px-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?f7f9db 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDagger.png/300px-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?f7f9db 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ritual_Dagger" title="Ritual Dagger"><img alt="Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/150px-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?5a4728" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/225px-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?5a4728 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/300px-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?5a4728 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ritual_Dagger" title="Ritual Dagger"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?db30e3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?db30e3 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDaggerPlus.png?db30e3 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Ritual_Dagger" title="Ritual Dagger"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?aa8a56" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?aa8a56 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-RitualDagger.png?aa8a56 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Ritual_Dagger" title="Ritual Dagger">Ritual Dagger</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Special" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Attack">Special - Colorless - Attack</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base">Deal 15 damage. <br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, permanently increase this card's damage by 3.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div><div class="desc-upg" style="display:none">Deal 15 damage. <br />If <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fatal" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fatal" title="Fatal"><span title="">Fatal</span></a></span>, permanently increase this card's damage by 5.<br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Exhaust" title="Exhaust"><span title="">Exhaust</span></a></span>.</div></div><div class="card-toggles"><span class="card-toggle-button upgrade-toggle" role="button" tabindex="0">Upgraded</span><span class="card-toggle-button beta-toggle" role="button">Beta Art</span></div></div></div><div class="card-box" data-name="Safety" data-rarity="Special" data-type="Skill" data-color="Colorless" data-canupgrade="true" data-hasbeta="true" data-cost="1" data-multiplayer="false" data-tags="Block Exhaust Retain"><span class="card-image-wrap"><span class="img-base"><a href="/wiki/Safety" title="Safety"><img alt="Colorless-Safety.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-Safety.png/150px-Colorless-Safety.png?9233df" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-Safety.png/225px-Colorless-Safety.png?9233df 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-Safety.png/300px-Colorless-Safety.png?9233df 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Safety" title="Safety"><img alt="Colorless-SafetyPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/150px-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?5ca972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/225px-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?5ca972 1.5x, /images/thumb/Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/300px-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?5ca972 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta-upg" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Safety" title="Safety"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?934caa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?934caa 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-SafetyPlus.png?934caa 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span><span class="img-beta" style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/Safety" title="Safety"><img alt="Beta-Colorless-Safety.png" src="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Safety.png/150px-Beta-Colorless-Safety.png?f24462" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="150" height="193" srcset="/images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Safety.png/225px-Beta-Colorless-Safety.png?f24462 1.5x, /images/thumb/Beta-Colorless-Safety.png/300px-Beta-Colorless-Safety.png?f24462 2x" data-file-width="678" data-file-height="874" /></a></span></span><div class="card-text"><div class="card-title compendium-cell-title"><a href="/wiki/Safety" class="mw-redirect" title="Safety">Safety</a></div><div class="card-meta" data-rarity="Special" data-color="Colorless" data-type="Skill">Special - Colorless - Skill</div><div class="card-desc compendium-cell-desc"><div class="desc-base"><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Retain" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Retain" title="Keywords">Retain</a></span>. <br />Gain 12 <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block">Block</a></span>. <br /><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel=